{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1273287-trinity-continuum-\u00e6on-errata","id":1273287,"title":"Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on errata","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-12-07T11:17:46-08:00","id":1273287,"title":"Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on errata","content":"Please list your errata for the <b>Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on</b> rulebook here.<ul><li>Please address only typos, layout glitches, misplaced elements, and similar errors. If it's merely a matter where you'd have phrased something differently, that's not errata, and should go in a different thread.</li> <li>Please confine comments to posting errata. Discussion should also go elsewhere.</li> <li>Missing art and Page XXs are known quantities and are not being called out at this time. There's no need to list them here.</li> </ul><br /> Thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T04:10:42-08:00","id":1273414,"title":"","content":"The world map, p.40-41 - what is Israel-Judah? The name doesn\u2019t appear anywhere else in the book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T06:30:17-08:00","id":1273426,"title":"","content":"p222: Psycholocation is formatted as if it were a power, rather than a Mode.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>---------------------------------------------<br /> Supporter of Spirits getting full playable splat design come Exalted 3E.<br /> Refugee from the 3rd Great Edition Wars of D&amp;D. <br /> oWoD Latecomer, Exalted Optimist, Scion ST, Trinity Curious","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/955-yue-ryong","name":"Yue Ryong","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar955_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T09:51:06-08:00","id":1273456,"title":"","content":"Pg 301: Ground Vehicle chart titles are top aligned instead of bottom aligned like other charts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23807-greenozzy","name":"Greenozzy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T10:07:36-08:00","id":1273460,"title":"","content":"The front page sub-title has an incorrect apostrophe.<br /> It should be &quot;EVERY AGE HAS ITS HEROES&quot;.<br /> There is no apostrophe in ITS (because it's a possessive, not a contraction).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24910-dbhertz","name":"dbhertz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T11:30:45-08:00","id":1273471,"title":"","content":"Aeon Character Sheet has only the starting three Path spaces, rather than the five you can grow into (also arguably has no need to spend as much space on declaring Path categories).<br /> Sheet also has Moment of Inspiration, unnecessarily for Psion characters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>---------------------------------------------<br /> Supporter of Spirits getting full playable splat design come Exalted 3E.<br /> Refugee from the 3rd Great Edition Wars of D&amp;D. <br /> oWoD Latecomer, Exalted Optimist, Scion ST, Trinity Curious","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/955-yue-ryong","name":"Yue Ryong","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar955_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T20:24:51-08:00","id":1273542,"title":"","content":"WORLD MAP, in FSA,<br /> <br /> The borders between Canada, USA and Mexico are still present. Aren't FSA the union of the 3 in 1 country? Why the borders?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:10px\">Gangrel Clan forever!!!</span>","edited":{"userid":5522,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5522-alheim-dalstar","user":"Alheim Dalstar","date":". 12-08-2018, 11:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5522-alheim-dalstar","name":"Alheim Dalstar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-08T20:29:15-08:00","id":1273543,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1273287-trinity-continuum-\u00e6on-errata#post1273287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Please list your errata for the <b>Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on</b> rulebook here.<ul><li>Please address only typos, layout glitches, misplaced elements, and similar errors. If it's merely a matter where you'd have phrased something differently, that's not errata, and should go in a different thread.</li> <li>Please confine comments to posting errata. Discussion should also go elsewhere.</li> <li>Missing art and Page XXs are known quantities and are not being called out at this time. There's no need to list them here.</li> </ul><br /> Thank you.</div> </div> </div> </div>Please read Ian\u2019s notice at top in regards to not needing to post PageXX or missing art errata here.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5-richt","name":"RichT","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5_2.jpeg","title":"Onyx Path Creative Director","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-09T06:58:16-08:00","id":1273579,"title":"","content":"A small nit<br /> <br /> PG: 152: under Fourth Legion: Vigilis Mundi, second paragraph, the art is blocking out some of the text","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13091-thewanderingjewels","name":"TheWanderingJewels","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13091_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"112"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-09T12:03:29-08:00","id":1273612,"title":"","content":"p. 8: &quot;Ian Watson&quot; credit should be &quot;Ian A. A. Watson.&quot;<br /> p. 132: Legend text in image covered by Chapter text. Flip so they're at the top, if possible?<br /> p, 361: Planetary Data sidebar should be formatted at those on p. 91 etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-09T17:00:36-08:00","id":1273639,"title":"","content":"Page 32 under the &quot;calling a blank&quot; sidebar. Should read &quot;sufficiently wealthy.&quot; It currently reads &quot;sufficient wealthy.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=485\" data-tempid=\"temp_485_1538393298974_786\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1277-karpomatic","name":"karpomatic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1277_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"143"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-09T19:31:32-08:00","id":1273649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yue Ryong</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1273287-trinity-continuum-\u00e6on-errata?p=1273426#post1273426\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">p222: Psycholocation is formatted as if it were a power, rather than a Mode.</div> </div> </div> </div>Psycholocation is also incorrectly formatted in the index (Pg. 13)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23807-greenozzy","name":"Greenozzy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23807_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-09T23:02:08-08:00","id":1273671,"title":"","content":"One page 125 in the Trinity Aeon book, there is reference to a Extraordinary Attribute Edge. That phrasing is found no where else in either PDF. There is a Superior Trait on page 66 of the Trinity Core book, but with how those edges are formatted, it makes it sound like only Talents can get those edges. Should it be noted that any of the templates have access to those traits, or is there supposed to be a separate edge for Extraordinary Attribute?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24901-ulfstormbringer","name":"Ulfstormbringer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24901_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-10T00:21:08-08:00","id":1273677,"title":"","content":"The Character Sheet as well as the Back Cover(?) are not bookmarked. (I've seen Back Covers bookmarked in other books, but I don't remember if this is a thing that White Wolf/OPP does.)<br /> <br /> Also, the separate Character Sheet PDF does not match the layout in the character sheet at the back of the Aeon corebook. In fact, Gear, Weapons, Armor and Biotech are ALL missing from the separate Character Sheet PDF.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":2710,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","user":"Su-tehp","date":". 12-10-2018, 03:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-10T04:05:06-08:00","id":1273700,"title":"","content":"p. 309: At the article about leviathan jumpships:<br /> Is: &quot;They are the largest vessels <b>even </b>made by humans&quot;<br /> Should be: &quot;They are the largest vessels <b>ever </b>made by humans&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3122-shuragil","name":"shuragil","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-10T09:57:21-08:00","id":1273743,"title":"","content":"double entry because my computer was being weird...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23768,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23768-graywulfe","user":"graywulfe","date":". 12-10-2018, 02:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23768-graywulfe","name":"graywulfe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23768_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-10T11:03:03-08:00","id":1273753,"title":"","content":"pp. 170-171 The sentence that spans the page contains the following, &quot;...Cassel strives to make Orgotek the penultimate metacorp...&quot; I don't think that penultimate is the word you want to use here as it implies that Cassel is aiming for second best. I'm not sure what word you would want to use instead.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23768-graywulfe","name":"graywulfe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23768_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-10T16:43:56-08:00","id":1273805,"title":"","content":"Kinda super knit picky but pg. 77 header Southeast Asia is off horizontal line. It\u2019s a few pixels low so there is more space at top then the bottom.<br /> <br /> Page 93, same issue with \u201con the map.\u201d But to high vs low.<br /> <br /> Page. 130 \u201cspecial edge inner reserve\u201d touch to high.<br /> <br /> Not sure if ment to be high or not -<br /> <br /> Page. 131 both edges in red bars to high.<br /> <br /> Page. 150 red bar \u201cIn Formation\u201d to high.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6424,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","user":"Fuzzykuma","date":". 12-10-2018, 07:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-11T02:11:06-08:00","id":1273855,"title":"","content":"p66 - Reference to 'Great Britain' - should be 'the United Republic'<br /> <br /> p130 - Reference to 'the Black Pool' under the heading 'Special Edge: Pioneer Spirit' - Black/Red Pools were removed from the core rules at some point.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23864-khelbiros","name":"Khelbiros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23864_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-13T07:27:00-08:00","id":1274197,"title":"","content":"<b>Page 17: </b>&quot;The one unifying feature is that in <b>Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on</b> humanity has discovered a way to awaken certain individuals\u2019 latent psionic powers, transforming them into powerful psions.&quot;<br /> <br /> I think you want &quot;distinguishing&quot; or something of that nature instead of &quot;unifying&quot;, because that's the feature specific to Aeon and not present in the other games.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-13T12:26:26-08:00","id":1274234,"title":"","content":"p. 160, in the artwork, I think that's supposed to be &quot;antimatter&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24928-quantum-bob","name":"Quantum Bob","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-14T08:11:21-08:00","id":1274363,"title":"","content":"Page 207: The first sentence of the first paragraph on Familiar Connection is, I believe, missing a comma between the words &quot;year&quot; and &quot;or&quot; in the following section, &quot;...one day a week there for a <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">year or</span> interacted with...&quot; This is an Oxford comma, I believe, but I strongly support the Oxford comma and I believe it would aid the readability of this sentence.<br /> <br /> Page 207: The first sentence of the third paragraph on Familiar Connection has an extraneous &quot;is&quot; in the following section, &quot;...who <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">is </span>currently has a Sensory or Direct Connection...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23768,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23768-graywulfe","user":"graywulfe","date":". 12-14-2018, 12:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23768-graywulfe","name":"graywulfe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23768_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-14T09:38:11-08:00","id":1274378,"title":"","content":"Page 216: The first sentence of the last paragraph, I believe that the word giving is not the word you mean to use here. I suspect you mean turning, transmogrifying, or modifying.<br /> <br /> Page 228: The first sentence of System for Precision Understanding begins, &quot;Success allows the psion can to the target's...&quot; I believe there is an extra word and a missing word. I believe that the intent was something like, &quot; Success allows the psion to perceive the target's...&quot; <br /> <br /> Page 229: The second paragraph, first sentence ends with, &quot;...the attack listed below.&quot; In the current version of the document, the attack is at the top of the page so instead of below, should this above?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23768-graywulfe","name":"graywulfe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23768_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-14T10:44:44-08:00","id":1274391,"title":"","content":"Sorry for so many posts. I had a lot of time to collect notes when I could not easily post and I don't want to type up one long post to have it eaten when I post it... I have had bad experiences with that.<br /> <br /> Page 231: Second paragraph of the system for Modulation (the first paragraph starts on the previous page). The second sentence has an extraneous word. &quot;...reduces the damage from <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">of </span>energy-based...&quot; The word of in that sentence is unneeded.<br /> <br /> Page 231: First paragraph, first sentence of the Dynamic Control power has a wrong word, &quot;The photokinetic can now create or modify <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">multiply </span>light sources...&quot; Multiply should be multiple.<br /> <br /> Page 231: First paragraph, second sentence of the system for the Dynamic Control power has a wrong word, &quot;...each laser lasts for <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">once </span>Scene.&quot; Once should be one.<br /> <br /> Page 231: First paragraph, the last sentence of the system for the Dynamic Control power ends with, &quot;...tags available for Photonic Mastery.&quot; There is no Photonic Mastery power, I assume this means Photonic Power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23768-graywulfe","name":"graywulfe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23768_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-14T12:58:56-08:00","id":1274431,"title":"","content":"Page 233: The second sentence of system for the power Control references a table being below. The table is at the top of the page in this version of the document.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23768-graywulfe","name":"graywulfe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23768_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-14T13:13:57-08:00","id":1274434,"title":"","content":"On page 97 in the home harsh home paragraph the last part is written by an in setting prospective while the rest is written like a normal setting explaining, not sure if i am clear enough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5811-starkiller","name":"Starkiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-14T13:20:52-08:00","id":1274437,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Starkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1273287-trinity-continuum-\u00e6on-errata?p=1274434#post1274434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On page 97 in the home harsh home paragraph the last part is written by an in setting prospective while the rest is written like a normal setting explaining, not sure if i am clear enough.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's because that paragraph actually belongs at the bottom of the box <b>SUBJECT: SOME WORK OUT</b> at the bottom of the previous page, and not in the body text. This happens several times in the book, including on <b>page 108</b>, where &quot;I think that's when I passed out.&quot; should be at the bottom of the <b>PERSONAL LOG OF NJENDA JEPTOO</b> on page 107.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-14T16:25:17-08:00","id":1274475,"title":"","content":"On page 105 the phrase \u201cAirwhales consume portions of slats as well\u201d should have flats instead of slats","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5811-starkiller","name":"Starkiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-15T00:51:51-08:00","id":1274514,"title":"","content":"Not sure if this is errata or simply a normal convention, but everyone in the Credits (p. 10) is listed alphabetically except the artists, who don\u2019t appear to be in any order. <br /> <br /> (Also reported for Core.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-15T22:02:43-08:00","id":1274668,"title":"","content":"(Copied to the Core thread as well.)<br /> What is \u2018Health\u2019 on the character sheet? Both sheets already include Injury Conditions. Appears to be a holdover from WoD/CoD character sheets.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-15T22:13:35-08:00","id":1274669,"title":"","content":"P.124 - Clairsentience\u2019s modes should include Psycholocation, not &quot;Psychlocation&quot;.<br /> <br /> Also, in the PDF bookmarks, Psycholocation is linked as a subset of Psychometry rather than as its own Mode.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-16T02:30:15-08:00","id":1274680,"title":"","content":"p97 The third paragraph &quot;Everything is heavier here, and it\u2019s harder to breathe and it\u2019s not hot enough to make you pass out, but just enough to make you sweat like a bas- <br /> tard. Brian and me are used to it now, but I fear it\u2019s getting to him. <br /> Also... I think [redacted]. Even with our contracts still having a good 15 years left, I don\u2019t plan on leaving. I\u2019m a space colonist now!&quot; should belong in the text box on the previous page.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23864-khelbiros","name":"Khelbiros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23864_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-16T10:47:44-08:00","id":1274739,"title":"","content":"On the XP xchart it lists that the cost to advance a Path is 18 but on page 41 it states that it costs 5 XP.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/786-thedonnie","name":"thedonnie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-17T01:47:28-08:00","id":1274849,"title":"","content":"P.216, Gross Manipulation - &quot;He could grow additional eyes, plate herself in ar-mor, or sprout tentacles.&quot; Herself should be himself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-17T02:00:58-08:00","id":1274850,"title":"","content":"P.228 - Precision Understanding - &quot;System: Success allows the psion can to the tar-get's specific bioelectrical reaction to situations.&quot; Possibly should be \u2018System: Success allows the psion to sense the target's specific bioelectrical reaction to situations.\u2019","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-17T02:19:07-08:00","id":1274851,"title":"","content":"P.235 - Flash - &quot;the range (clash-his range) tag&quot; - should read (close-range) like the table on p.236. The table on p.236 should also change the reference to clash range to close range in the tag column.<br /> <br /> The table on p.237 needs to change clash range to close range as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":156,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","user":"Bunyip","date":". 12-17-2018, 05:28 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-17T02:32:29-08:00","id":1274852,"title":"","content":"P.240 - Subquantum Lock - references to \u2018him\u2019 should be \u2018her\u2019 as they\u2019re talking about General Larsson.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":156,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","user":"Bunyip","date":". 12-17-2018, 03:58 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-17T12:53:01-08:00","id":1274937,"title":"","content":"Page 278-279 is the art backwards? It seems by reading the writing on the wall.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5811-starkiller","name":"Starkiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-19T05:48:27-08:00","id":1275273,"title":"","content":"p. 25: &quot;2061 \u2014 Aberrant Calvert Wycoff explodes in Hastings Nebraska, in a huge plasma explosion that obliterates everything within 200 kilometers, and seriously damages soil fertility for more than 1,000 kilometers.&quot; There should be a comma between Hastings and Nebraska. The wording with &quot;explodes&quot; and &quot;explosion&quot; is awkward.<br /> <br /> P. 27: &quot;2120 \u2014 The Esperanza space station crash near Paris, devastating France.&quot; Should be &quot;crashes near Paris[.]&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-21T03:52:55-08:00","id":1275759,"title":"","content":"Page 205 in Psi trait table under Latent<br /> <br /> \u201c* Latent psions may have one dot in single Mode. \u201c<br /> <br /> Should there be an a between (in) a (single mode)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6424-fuzzykuma","name":"Fuzzykuma","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6424_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"178"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-21T07:43:56-08:00","id":1275799,"title":"","content":"Clarification request: What happens if a Mode is used on another individual and they move out of range before the duration ends? Impact determination re:cost committed &amp; Psion Awareness.<br /> <br /> p205: Strong Latents lack limiters in text on Mode dots. Unclear if error.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>---------------------------------------------<br /> Supporter of Spirits getting full playable splat design come Exalted 3E.<br /> Refugee from the 3rd Great Edition Wars of D&amp;D. <br /> oWoD Latecomer, Exalted Optimist, Scion ST, Trinity Curious","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/955-yue-ryong","name":"Yue Ryong","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar955_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-22T16:22:44-08:00","id":1276140,"title":"","content":"p.18 &quot;psions \u2014 individuals with latent psychic powers who gained active psychic powers&quot;<br /> Suggest replacing with &quot;psions -- indivduals with psychic powers&quot;<br /> The rest of the details are filled in later in the text, and this entry is unnecessarily complex.<br /> <br /> p.19<br /> &quot;Chapter Four: Character Creation explains everything you need to create psions, neutrals, or Talents in Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on.<br /> This is entirely inaccurate, as it requires use of the core book.<br /> &quot;Chapter Four: Character Creation Supplements the core book with additional rules, edges and paths for the creation of characters in Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on.&quot;<br /> Would be much more accurate.<br /> <br /> p.21 - Coalition Ark:<br /> &quot;speed of light and is on a course for the solar system.&quot; should be &quot;on a course for Earth's solar system&quot; or &quot;on a course for the Sol system&quot;<br /> <br /> p. 21 - Khantze Lu Ge: \u201cCastle in the Air;\u201d should be &quot;Castle in the Sky&quot; to be consistent with other entries on the colony.<br /> <br /> p. 23 - Teleportation<br /> &quot;It allows the psion to move themselves and others instantly from one location to another and to warp space.&quot;<br /> As the warping mode from 1e has been removed, should this definition be updated?<br /> <br /> p.23 - VARG<br /> &quot;Rules for full-sized VARGs appear in an upcoming supplement.&quot; should say &quot;will appear&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24507-baladain","name":"Baladain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-23T02:37:45-08:00","id":1276201,"title":"","content":"This was noticed over on the Kickstarter comments - posting here so it\u2019s not missed.<br /> <br /> On the AEon cover - &quot;Every Age Has It\u2019s Heroes&quot; - should be its, no apostrophe needed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-23T14:08:29-08:00","id":1276316,"title":"","content":"p. 25, 27 timeline<br /> Multi-entry years, 2056 and 2115/2122 are formatted differently. Please make consistent.<br /> <br /> p. 25,26 timeline 2067<br /> &quot;China takes control of all of the orbital nuclear weapons platforms&quot;<br /> This entry implies China seized control, where the section on the Ultimatum starting on p. 30 implies that the Chinese were the original owners of these weapons.<br /> <br /> p. 26 timeline 2090-2103<br /> End date mismatch. Either entry header should be changed to 2102 or sudamerican space elevator completion date should be changed to 2103<br /> <br /> p. 27 timeline - 2109 Should read &quot;The Qin establish <b>an </b>embassy on Luna, and an Earth embassy is established on Qinshui<br /> <br /> p.27 timeline 2116 should read &quot;<b>The </b>Upeo wa Macho mysteriously vanish,&quot; or &quot;<b>The </b>Upeo wa Macho <b>order</b> mysteriously vanishes&quot; (makes consistent with the use of name on p.177)<br /> <br /> p. 27 timeline 2120 should read &quot;The Esperanza space station <b>crashes</b> near Paris, devastating France <b>and Belgium</b>.&quot;<br /> <br /> p. 27 timeline 2122 should read &quot;<b>The</b> Upeo wa Macho <b>return</b> from the stars&quot; or &quot;<b>The </b>Upeo wa Macho <b>order</b> returns from the stars.&quot; (makes consistent with the use of name on p.177)<br /> <br /> p. 28 &quot;novas created new energy sources&quot; should be &quot;new energy technologies&quot; as neither reactors nor batteries are energy sources. (the fuel in the reactor is a source)<br /> <br /> p. 28 - Introduction to quantum flux<br /> &quot;Corrupted zones&quot; and &quot;tainted land&quot; should these be capitalized consistently?<br /> <br /> p. 31 The New Opnet<br /> &quot;The wireless OpNet access is now available&quot; should read &quot;Wireless OpNet access is now available&quot;<br /> <br /> p.37 UPEO WA MACHO VANISHES<br /> multiple instances of order name being used in ways that are not consistent with the main section on p.177","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24507,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24507-baladain","user":"Baladain","date":". 12-23-2018, 07:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24507-baladain","name":"Baladain","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"68"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-25T06:22:11-08:00","id":1276618,"title":"","content":"Query/System-Absence: Should Psions get an increased cap on Advanced Items as Talents do (Core, p91)?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>---------------------------------------------<br /> Supporter of Spirits getting full playable splat design come Exalted 3E.<br /> Refugee from the 3rd Great Edition Wars of D&amp;D. <br /> oWoD Latecomer, Exalted Optimist, Scion ST, Trinity Curious","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/955-yue-ryong","name":"Yue Ryong","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar955_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"147"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-12-30T00:57:35-08:00","id":1277462,"title":"","content":"Biokinesis - Psychomorphing - Enhance (p. 214-215) - Fluff says characters can raise physical Attributes to \u2018maximum human levels\u2019, which Trinity Core defines as 6 for Talents and other special characters (TC p. 37), but Enhance\u2019s system then limits boosting Attributes to a max of 5 dots in each Attiribute. <br /> <br /> (Edit to add: TC p. 54 says \u201cAttributes are generally rated from 1-5. Some characters may have the ability to raise their normal maximum to 6, though this requires an Edge\u201c, which is consistent with AEon but possibly inconsistent with p. 37.)<br /> <br /> Question 1 - is \u2018maximum human limit\u2019 5 dots or 6 as per TC Core? Follow-on - p.125 of Aeon says Proxies can raise Attributes to 6 dots (or 7 with Superior Attribute Edge, which p.125 erroneously calls the Extraordinary Attribute Edge - needs to be changed.)<br /> <br /> Question 2 - Other boosting powers (Enhancement in Electromanipulation, and dots 2-4 of Augendis) allow Attributes to be raised to 7 dots. Is Biokinesis\u2019s limit deliberately lower?<br /> <br /> Question 3 - Do Proxies or other characters with the Superior Attribute Edge have access to higher than 5 dots from Enhance, which should be specified in text?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":156,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","user":"Bunyip","date":". 12-30-2018, 04:02 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-01T17:52:07-08:00","id":1277962,"title":"","content":"p. 235 - The Cost of Thermokinesis Flash should probably be \u20180 or 1 Psi points\u2019 with the former applying to the examples of starting a fire and chilling beverages, and the latter applying to flame and frost attacks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7123-archive111","name":"Archive111","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-01T23:01:40-08:00","id":1278004,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Archive111</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1273287-trinity-continuum-\u00e6on-errata?p=1277962#post1277962\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">p. 235 - The Cost of Thermokinesis Flash should probably be \u20180 or 1 Psi points\u2019 with the former applying to the examples of starting a fire and chilling beverages, and the latter applying to flame and frost attacks.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, still costs 1 if the SG has reason to keep track. If the power is just going to be used for flavour in a scene where accounting isn\u2019t important, subtracting one point doesn\u2019t matter because it\u2019ll recharge before anyone notices.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-03T23:07:58-08:00","id":1278506,"title":"","content":"Alertness p. 225 - consider changing the increased difficulty this power gives to the Inflict Damage stunt to Mode Dots/2, rather than +1 per success spent. As the psion gains greater dice pools and benefits from Enhancement with greater Dots in the Mode (with this being the first dot power), this could easily add huge degrees of difficulty to inflicting damage for a zero cost power.<br /> <br /> Edit: On further reflection of this power, a better effect might be that the Clear adds Mode Dots to her Defense, rather than just adding Difficulty to the Inflict Damage stunt. This makes more narrative sense as the clairsentient is then more protected from the attack itself - which is what her precognitive sight would be looking for - rather than the outcome. Under the current wording the Clear is just as susceptible to attacks but more resistant to damage, but still vulnerable to grappling, being disarmed, being blinded, being knocked down, being shoved, not seeing that the attacker\u2019s move is a feint etc.<br /> <br /> I\u2019m suggesting Mode Dots rather than Mode Dots/2 because I still think it makes sense for powerful precogs to be *very* hard to hit. Otha Herzog should have +7 Defense if he wants it. A 5 dot precognitive Clear should see you coming from miles away.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":156,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","user":"Bunyip","date":". 01-04-2019, 04:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-04T09:24:05-08:00","id":1278610,"title":"","content":"page 142: Alarmed, General <b>Solveg</b> Larssen dispatched several hundred<br /> page 145: Herzog's clairsentience only <b>conformed</b> the fact that many people felt lost - should be conf<b>i</b>irmed<br /> page 148:<b> Also</b>, the Storyguide is <b>also</b> free to use this Edge for the character - one also too many<br /> page 156: Both <b>Christian</b> and Muslims were frequently persecuted - should be Christians","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24456,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24456-xizzillix","user":"Xizzillix","date":". 01-09-2019, 09:32 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24456-xizzillix","name":"Xizzillix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-05T00:44:07-08:00","id":1278780,"title":"","content":"P.264 - Direction (Augendis 3) system says \u201cThe psion can also either temporarily increase or decrease the speed of biological processes, like breathing or healing by successes spent\u201c but doesn\u2019t say what change per success. Is it doubled/halved per success or multiplied/divided by the number of successes spent?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-07T06:46:44-08:00","id":1279187,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bunyip</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1273287-trinity-continuum-\u00e6on-errata?p=1278780#post1278780\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">P.264 - Direction (Augendis 3) system says \u201cThe psion can also either temporarily increase or decrease the speed of biological processes, like breathing or healing by successes spent\u201c but doesn\u2019t say what change per success. Is it doubled/halved per success or multiplied/divided by the number of successes spent?</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe use the same mechanics as the biokinetic power Metabolic Control (p. 213)?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3122-shuragil","name":"shuragil","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-07T06:49:51-08:00","id":1279188,"title":"","content":"Metabolic Control (p. 213):<br /> <br /> So you can multiply/divide the time of bilogical functions (e.g. breathing, healing) by number of successes. Later sentence says:<br /> &quot;The character can spend additional successes to further change this rate on a one-for-one basis.&quot;<br /> This doesn't make sense, as you already spent your successes. Are psi points meant here instead of successes?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3122-shuragil","name":"shuragil","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-08T07:11:35-08:00","id":1279460,"title":"","content":"page 168: Trusted agents are given the few experimental pieces of biotech that the order produces, and often never <b>sees</b> them again - should be see<br /> page 175: Running <b>a</b> Orgotek campaign - should be an<br /> page 176: Path Concepts: espionage <b>pperative</b> - should be operative<br /> page 187: <b>Nordamericans</b> are routinely oppressed - shouldn't it be North Americans?<br /> page 190: where players will discover <b>a</b> dangerous <b>Aberrants</b> - should either drop &quot;a&quot; or the plural &quot;-s&quot;<br /> page 206/207: the times for fading connections aren't very clear, and they are not listed in the table<br /> page 212: The form endures while she commits <b>this</b> Psi point - should be these I think<br /> page 215: to shift the attitude <b>over</b> everyone in close