g <b>times</b><br /> page 235: the range (<b>clash</b>-his range) tag - should be close<br /> page 237: can perform any task that she would normally be able to do with <b>his</b> hands - should be her<br /> page 237: The table for Velocity lists the Ranged (<b>clash</b>-range) tag - should be close<br /> page 238: If desired, the <b>telekinetic</b> - shouldn't it be psychokinetic?<br /> page 239: a field can support <b>up</b> objects - up can be dropped I think<br /> page 243: from either all psi powers or all Quantum <b>power</b> - should be powers<br /> page 243: for every <b>addition</b> Psi point he spends - should be additional<br /> page 243: the pool of any single psion <b>with</b> his range - should be within<br /> page 244: Aberrants and other beings without a Psi trait instead suffer <b>this</b> increased Difficulty to all rolls - should be an<br /> page 245: using any remaining successes <b>an</b> Enhancement to the roll - should be as<br /> page 245: device up to the <b>psion's his</b> Size parameter - one should be dropped<br /> page 247: Phobia seems to miss the (Persistent) tag<br /> page 248: but telepath can only <b>communication</b> with a single individual at a time - missing <b>the</b>; should be communicate<br /> page 248: <b>[STOP TABLING THIS]</b> after the Emotional Intensity Chart should be dropped<br /> page 249: <b>This</b> telepath sways the mood of entire crowds - should be the I think<br /> page 249: on a single target in line <b>or</b> sight - should be of<br /> page 249: allowing the psion to <b>creation</b> an emotion - should be create<br /> page 249: where the <b>emotional </b>would be beneficial - should be emotion<br /> page 250: or she provoke someone to murderous rage - missing <b>can</b><br /> page 250: sometimes <b>induce</b> the target to continue to feel - should be induces<br /> page 250: possess a noetic connection someone - missing <b>to</b><br /> page 252: This transfer can include more <b>that</b> Skill dots - should be than<br /> page 255: add his Psi as a Complication teleportation rolls - missing <b>to</b><br /> page 265: The psion can add one dot to his target's Finesse Attributes <b>per</b> success spent <b>to the patient's Finesse Attributes</b> - should be changed to for every like in the description of the previous powers; the second reference to Attributes hould be dropped","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24456,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24456-xizzillix","user":"Xizzillix","date":". 01-09-2019, 05:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24456-xizzillix","name":"Xizzillix","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-10T11:26:33-08:00","id":1279931,"title":"","content":"Page 234: The first sentence of System for the Subquantum Computing power has an extraneous '<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">to</span>' in the sentence, &quot;The Proxy can access <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>to </b></span>any device...<br /> <br /> Page 234: The last sentence of the Distant Touch basic power is missing a word, possibly the word '<span style=\"color:#0000FF\">times</span>', &quot;This power lasts successes <span style=\"color:#0000FF\"><b>_</b></span> her Psi in minutes.&quot;<br /> <br /> Page 271: There is an extraneous '<span style=\"color:#FF0000\">but</span>' in the second sentence of the Psi tag. &quot;...all formatted armor gains some <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>but </b></span>additional benefit...&quot;<br /> <br /> Page 293: The Tolerance cost for the Space Maneuver Pack biotech item has a strange note regarding cost for &quot;neutrals&quot; that is higher than for non-neutrals. Is that accurate?<br /> <br /> Page 306: The first sentence of the Thrusters and Reactors section on &quot;Vital Spacecraft Systems,&quot; has the word <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">rockets </span>where I think the <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">reactors </span>should be used. &quot;Hyperfusion <span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>rockets </b></span>supply energy to the thrusters...&quot;<br /> <br /> Page 363: In the last sentence of the second paragraph on Noetic vs Quantum Destinies, the word '<b><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">All,</span></b>' feels extraneous. &quot;<span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>All</b></span>, the most powerful inspired powers...&quot;<br /> <br /> \u200b","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23768-graywulfe","name":"graywulfe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23768_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-10T17:41:30-08:00","id":1280007,"title":"","content":"The summary rules for hacking on 199 say the attitude of the system applies as an enhancement to either he hacker or the system it the detailed rules on 201 do not mention this. The attitude is only described as the number of hacking increments to get access.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24935-werlynn","name":"werlynn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"192"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-12T13:34:20-08:00","id":1280396,"title":"","content":"P. 145, &quot;Herzog's clairsentience only <b>conformed</b> the fact...&quot; should be &quot;Herzog's clairsentience only <b>confirmed </b>the fact...&quot;<br /> P. 355, table header &quot;<b>QUIN</b> SHUTTLE&quot; should be &quot;<b>QIN</b> SHUTTLE&quot;<br /> P. 358, &quot;<b>Quinshui&quot; </b>should be &quot;<b>Qinshui</b>&quot;<br /> P. 286, &quot;rubenesque&quot; should be capitalized","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3453-nephandi","name":"Nephandi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3453_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-01-13T14:23:26-08:00","id":1280553,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1273287-trinity-continuum-\u00e6on-errata#post1273287\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Please list your errata for the <b>Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on</b> rulebook here.<ul><li>Please address only typos, layout glitches, misplaced elements, and similar errors. If it's merely a matter where you'd have phrased something differently, that's not errata, and should go in a different thread.</li> <li>Please confine comments to posting errata. Discussion should also go elsewhere.</li> <li>Missing art and Page XXs are known quantities and are not being called out at this time. There's no need to list them here.</li> </ul><br /> Thank you.</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019m not sure if \u201cthis rules issue is ambiguous and should be clairfied in the text\u201d falls under the category of errata, and if not, I apologize<br /> <br /> But as is becoming clear from multiple threads, it is unclear to what extent Psions are supposed to have the advantage of Scale in interaction, power use, and other combat actions, over baselines and Talents. Clarifying the explicit intent in the text would be very helpful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}